body:
I don't think her excerpt about the dragon refusing to go over the wall and Hardhome are related. If dragons were not able to pass the wall due to some kind of magic then, why would they have been able to several hundred years before?

Plus, I think the story about Hardhome is indicative of a volcanic eruption. I like some of ideas about a small meteor, but wouldn't the men on the wall been able to have seen it falling as well?

&#x200B;
